<br>▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> : 연수신청서 1부<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제 출 처</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> : 취업정보센터<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">접수마감</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2010. 6. 30(수)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">참가자선정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2010. 7. 6(화) 개별 통보<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">문 의 처</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> : 취업정보센터(478-7211~2)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
